Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:32.70,Etiqueta,,0,0,0,,Escena recreada
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:01.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mi padre lleva
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\c&H3CD2FF&}cuarenta años{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:02.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,arreglándolo todo en casa…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:03.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,y hoy un tornillo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.30,0:00:04.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,le está ganando.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.20,0:00:05.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Me arregló la bici,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:05.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,las persianas,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.70,0:00:07.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,la estantería de mi primer piso…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.80,0:00:09.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nunca ha llamado a nadie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.30,0:00:10.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Es que aquí {\c&H3CD2FF&}no cabe{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:11.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,ni la mano…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:12.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,¡La tubería,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.60,0:00:13.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,hombre!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:15.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Papá, prueba con esto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:18.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,¿Y esto qué es?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:20.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,Se desmonta y le cambias la forma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:21.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mira, {\c&H3CD2FF&}en L.{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:25.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Iba a ser
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.50,0:00:26.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,su {\c&H3CD2FF&}regalo de Navidad…{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:27.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Si tu padre también
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.70,0:00:28.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,es el que lo arregla todo,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.90,0:00:29.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,regálale algo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:30.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,que use de verdad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:24.60,Rotulo,,0,0,0,,Carraca de 60 dientes
